{"name": "Periodic Table", "html": "<!doctype html>\n<!--\n  Periodic Table — MyLLMos™ App Gallery · © 2026 Opticell Ltd\n  Source-available: read it, remix it, run your version inside MyLLM™.\n  Not for redistribution or republication. Terms: https://github.com/TeamDzX/myllm-assets/blob/main/LICENSE\n--><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover,user-scalable=no\">\n<title>Periodic Table</title>\n<meta name=\"myllm:immersive\" content=\"on\">\n<style>:root{--build-id:\"2e9cdc0b13\";color-scheme:light dark;\n  --bg1:#f5f6fa; --bg2:#e9ecf5; --ink:#141824; --muted:#6b7285; --faint:#a3a9b8; --line:rgba(20,24,40,.09);\n  --chip:rgba(20,24,40,.06); --card:#ffffff; --acc:#5b5bf0; --acc2:#8b5cf6; --sheet:#ffffff;\n  --shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.8) inset,0 2px 6px rgba(30,35,60,.08);\n  --L:88%; --Lb:72%; --Lt:22%; --S:78%; --St:55%;\n  --font:-apple-system,\"SF Pro Text\",system-ui,sans-serif; --round:-apple-system,\"SF Pro Rounded\",\"SF Pro Display\",system-ui,sans-serif; }\n@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){ :root{\n  --bg1:#0a0c12; --bg2:#151926; --ink:#eef0f6; --muted:#8d94a8; --faint:#555c70; --line:rgba(255,255,255,.08);\n  --chip:rgba(255,255,255,.07); --card:#171b27; --sheet:#141824;\n  --shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.06) inset,0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.35);\n  --L:21%; --Lb:36%; --Lt:88%; --S:48%; --St:80%; } }\n*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none}\nhtml,body{height:100%;overflow:hidden;overscroll-behavior:none}\nbody{font-family:var(--font);color:var(--ink);background:radial-gradient(130% 60% at 50% 0%,var(--bg2),var(--bg1) 70%);background-color:var(--bg1);\n  height:100vh;height:100dvh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;touch-action:manipulation;\n  padding:env(safe-area-inset-top) env(safe-area-inset-right) 0 env(safe-area-inset-left)}\nbutton{font:inherit;color:inherit;border:0;background:none;cursor:pointer}\n\n/* Header */\n.head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:8px 14px 6px;flex-shrink:0}\n.tile{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:10px;display:grid;place-items:center;flex-shrink:0;\n  background:linear-gradient(145deg,#7c7cff,#a855f7);box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(124,92,255,.32)}\n.tile svg{width:20px;height:20px;color:#fff}\n.ht{min-width:0;flex:1}\n.ht h1{font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.2px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.acts{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}\n.hbtn{height:36px;min-width:36px;padding:0 10px;border-radius:11px;background:var(--chip);display:grid;place-items:center;\n  font-size:13px;font-weight:650;color:var(--ink);transition:transform .12s,background .2s}\n.hbtn:active{transform:scale(.93)}\n.hbtn svg{width:17px;height:17px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}\n.hbtn.on{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#7c7cff,#a855f7);color:#fff}\n\n/* Search */\n.search{display:none;padding:0 14px 8px;flex-shrink:0;position:relative}\nbody.searching .search{display:block}\n.search input{width:100%;height:40px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--card);color:var(--ink);\n  font:inherit;font-size:16px;padding:0 12px 0 36px;outline:none;-webkit-user-select:text;user-select:text}\n.search input:focus{border-color:var(--acc)}\n.search svg{position:absolute;left:26px;top:11px;width:18px;height:18px;fill:none;stroke:var(--muted);stroke-width:2;stroke-linecap:round}\n.results{position:absolute;left:14px;right:14px;top:44px;background:var(--sheet);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;z-index:6;\n  box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.18);max-height:240px;overflow-y:auto;display:none}\n.results.show{display:block}\n.results button{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;width:100%;padding:9px 12px;text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}\n.results button:last-child{border-bottom:0}\n.results .rs{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:9px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:700;font-size:15px}\n.results .rn{font-size:15px;line-height:1.35}\n.results .rz{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.35}\n.results .none{padding:14px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\n\n/* Mode chips */\n.modes{display:flex;gap:6px;overflow-x:auto;padding:0 14px 8px;flex-shrink:0;scrollbar-width:none}\n.modes::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}\n.modes button{flex-shrink:0;height:32px;padding:0 12px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--chip);font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--muted);transition:.2s}\n.modes button.on{background:var(--ink);color:var(--bg1)}\n\n/* Legend */\n.legend{flex-shrink:0;padding:0 14px 8px;min-height:40px}\n.cats{display:flex;gap:6px;overflow-x:auto;scrollbar-width:none;padding-bottom:1px}\n.cats::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}\n.cats button{flex-shrink:0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:30px;padding:0 10px 0 8px;border-radius:9px;background:var(--chip);\n  font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);transition:opacity .2s,transform .12s}\n.cats button i{width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:4px;display:block}\n.cats button.off{opacity:.38}\n.cats button:active{transform:scale(.95)}\n.grad{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.35}\n.grad .bar{flex:1;height:12px;border-radius:6px}\n.grad b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap}\n.temp{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}\n.temp input{flex:1;accent-color:var(--acc);height:28px}\n.temp .tv{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;min-width:84px;text-align:right;line-height:1.35}\n.temp .unit{height:28px;padding:0 9px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--chip);font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700}\n.states{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:6px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.35}\n.states span{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px}\n.states i{width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:3px;display:block}\n\n/* Table */\n.stage{position:relative;flex:1;min-height:0}\n.scroller{position:absolute;inset:0;overflow:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;touch-action:pan-x pan-y;overscroll-behavior:contain;scrollbar-width:none}\n.scroller::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}\n.table{--t:52px;--g:4px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(18,var(--t));grid-template-rows:repeat(7,var(--t)) calc(var(--t)*.34) repeat(2,var(--t));\n  gap:var(--g);padding:8px 14px calc(84px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));width:max-content;margin:0 auto}\n.el{position:relative;border-radius:calc(var(--t)*.16);background:hsl(var(--h) var(--S) var(--L));color:hsl(var(--h) var(--St) var(--Lt));\n  box-shadow:var(--shadow),0 0 0 1px hsl(var(--h) calc(var(--S) - 10%) var(--Lb)) inset;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\n  transition:opacity .25s,transform .12s,filter .25s;overflow:hidden;line-height:1.15}\n.el.heat{background:var(--hc);color:var(--ht);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}\n.el.nodata{background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,var(--chip) 0 5px,transparent 5px 10px);color:var(--muted);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--line) inset}\n.el:active{transform:scale(.93)}\n.el.dim{opacity:.16;filter:saturate(.3)}\n.el.hit{box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--acc),0 6px 16px rgba(91,91,240,.35)}\n.el .z{position:absolute;left:calc(var(--t)*.09);top:calc(var(--t)*.06);font-size:calc(var(--t)*.18);font-weight:600;opacity:.8;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.el .s{font-family:var(--round);font-size:calc(var(--t)*.4);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-top:calc(var(--t)*.06)}\n.el .n{font-size:calc(var(--t)*.14);font-weight:500;opacity:.85;max-width:94%;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;margin-top:calc(var(--t)*.01)}\n.el .fav{position:absolute;right:calc(var(--t)*.08);top:calc(var(--t)*.05);font-size:calc(var(--t)*.17);color:#f5a623}\n.table.small .el .n,.table.small .el .z{display:none}\n.table.small .el .s{margin-top:0;font-size:calc(var(--t)*.46)}\n.ph{border-radius:calc(var(--t)*.16);display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:calc(var(--t)*.2);font-weight:650;color:var(--muted);\n  background:var(--chip);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--line) inset;line-height:1.2;text-align:center}\n.gapcard{grid-column:3 / 13;grid-row:1 / 4;align-self:stretch;margin:calc(var(--t)*.05) calc(var(--t)*.25) calc(var(--t)*.2);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:calc(var(--t)*.3);\n  padding:0 calc(var(--t)*.2);border-radius:calc(var(--t)*.24);overflow:hidden}\n.gapcard .big{width:calc(var(--t)*2.3);height:calc(var(--t)*2.3);border-radius:calc(var(--t)*.3);flex-shrink:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\n  background:hsl(var(--h,250) var(--S) var(--L));color:hsl(var(--h,250) var(--St) var(--Lt));box-shadow:var(--shadow),0 0 0 1px hsl(var(--h,250) calc(var(--S) - 10%) var(--Lb)) inset;line-height:1.15;cursor:pointer}\n.gapcard .big .s{font-family:var(--round);font-size:calc(var(--t)*1);font-weight:750;letter-spacing:-.03em}\n.gapcard .big .z{font-size:calc(var(--t)*.26);font-weight:650;opacity:.8}\n.gapcard .info{min-width:0}\n.gapcard .info h2{font-size:calc(var(--t)*.42);line-height:1.25;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.01em;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.gapcard .info p{font-size:calc(var(--t)*.25);line-height:1.4;color:var(--muted)}\n.gapcard .info p b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}\n.table.small .gapcard .info p.more{display:none}\n.zoom{position:absolute;right:14px;bottom:calc(14px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));display:flex;gap:2px;padding:4px;border-radius:14px;background:var(--sheet);\n  box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.18),0 0 0 1px var(--line) inset;z-index:4}\n.zoom button{width:40px;height:36px;border-radius:10px;display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--ink)}\n.zoom button:active{background:var(--chip)}\n.zoom svg{width:18px;height:18px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.2;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}\n.aboutlink{position:absolute;left:14px;bottom:calc(14px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));height:44px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:14px;background:var(--sheet);\n  box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.18),0 0 0 1px var(--line) inset;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--muted);z-index:4;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n.aboutlink svg{width:16px;height:16px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2;stroke-linecap:round}\n\n/* Sheets */\n.scrim{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(5,8,20,.45);opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .28s;z-index:10}\n.scrim.open{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}\n.sheet{position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:11;background:var(--sheet);border-radius:24px 24px 0 0;max-height:90%;max-height:90dvh;\n  display:flex;flex-direction:column;transform:translateY(105%);transition:transform .34s cubic-bezier(.2,.85,.25,1);box-shadow:0 -12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.28);\n  padding-left:env(safe-area-inset-left);padding-right:env(safe-area-inset-right)}\n.sheet.open{transform:none}\n.grab{width:38px;height:5px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--faint);opacity:.6;margin:8px auto 2px;flex-shrink:0}\n.sbody{overflow-y:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;padding:6px 18px calc(22px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));overscroll-behavior:contain}\n.sclose{position:absolute;right:14px;top:12px;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--chip);display:grid;place-items:center;z-index:2}\n.sclose svg{width:14px;height:14px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.6;stroke-linecap:round}\n@media (min-width:700px){ .sheet{left:50%;right:auto;width:640px;margin-left:-320px} }\n\n.hero{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center;margin:4px 0 14px}\n.card{width:128px;height:128px;border-radius:24px;flex-shrink:0;position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\n  background:linear-gradient(160deg,hsl(var(--h) var(--S) calc(var(--L) + 3%)),hsl(var(--h) var(--S) var(--L)));color:hsl(var(--h) var(--St) var(--Lt));\n  box-shadow:0 10px 26px hsl(var(--h) 60% 40% / .25),0 0 0 1px hsl(var(--h) calc(var(--S) - 10%) var(--Lb)) inset;line-height:1.15}\n.card .z{position:absolute;left:12px;top:9px;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;opacity:.8}\n.card .m{position:absolute;right:12px;top:10px;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;opacity:.75}\n.card .s{font-family:var(--round);font-size:56px;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin-top:6px}\n.card .n{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;opacity:.85}\n.bohr{flex:1;min-width:0;display:grid;place-items:center}\n.bohr svg{width:100%;max-width:150px;height:auto;overflow:visible}\n.orb{transform-origin:80px 80px;animation:spin linear infinite}\n@keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}\n.dname{font-size:26px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:-.02em}\n.dsub{font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px}\n.drow{display:flex;gap:8px;margin:14px 0 4px}\n.drow button{flex:1;height:42px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--chip);font-size:14.5px;font-weight:600;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px}\n.drow button svg{width:17px;height:17px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}\n.drow button.star.on{color:#f5a623}\n.drow button.star.on svg{fill:#f5a623;stroke:#f5a623}\n.drow .ask{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#7c7cff,#a855f7);color:#fff}\n.props{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin-top:12px}\n.prop{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:10px 12px;min-width:0}\n.prop.wide{grid-column:1 / -1}\n.prop .k{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:.3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.4}\n.prop .v{font-size:17px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35;margin-top:2px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;overflow-wrap:anywhere}\n.prop .v small{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:500;color:var(--muted)}\n.prop .v sup{font-size:.62em;line-height:0}\n.aiout{margin-top:14px;border-radius:16px;padding:14px;background:linear-gradient(160deg,rgba(124,124,255,.12),rgba(168,85,247,.08));border:1px solid rgba(124,124,255,.25);display:none}\n.aiout.show{display:block}\n.aiout h3{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.3px;color:var(--acc);text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1.4}\n.aiout .txt{font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.55;margin-top:6px;white-space:pre-wrap;-webkit-user-select:text;user-select:text}\n.aiout .note{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px;line-height:1.4}\n.dots span{display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--acc);margin-right:4px;animation:bob 1s infinite}\n.dots span:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.15s}.dots span:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.3s}\n@keyframes bob{50%{transform:translateY(-4px);opacity:.5}}\n\n/* Quiz + About */\n.qh{font-size:22px;font-weight:750;line-height:1.3;margin:6px 40px 4px 0}\n.qp{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.4}\n.qbar{height:6px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--chip);margin:12px 0 16px;overflow:hidden}\n.qbar i{display:block;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#7c7cff,#a855f7);transition:width .3s}\n.qq{font-size:19px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.4;margin-bottom:14px;text-align:center}\n.qbig{width:112px;height:112px;margin:0 auto 14px;border-radius:22px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-family:var(--round);font-size:52px;font-weight:750;\n  background:hsl(var(--h) var(--S) var(--L));color:hsl(var(--h) var(--St) var(--Lt));box-shadow:var(--shadow),0 0 0 1px hsl(var(--h) calc(var(--S) - 10%) var(--Lb)) inset;line-height:1.2}\n.qopts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}\n.qopts button{min-height:54px;border-radius:14px;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);font-size:16px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.3;padding:8px;transition:transform .1s,background .2s}\n.qopts button:active{transform:scale(.97)}\n.qopts button.right{background:#22c55e;color:#fff;border-color:#22c55e}\n.qopts button.wrong{background:#ef4444;color:#fff;border-color:#ef4444}\n.qend{text-align:center;padding:10px 0}\n.qend .score{font-size:56px;font-weight:800;font-family:var(--round);line-height:1.2;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#7c7cff,#a855f7);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}\n.qend p{color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;margin-top:4px}\n.bigbtn{width:100%;height:50px;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#7c7cff,#a855f7);color:#fff;font-size:16.5px;font-weight:650;margin-top:16px}\n.about h2{font-size:22px;font-weight:750;line-height:1.3;margin:6px 40px 10px 0}\n.about p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:10px}\n.about p.m{color:var(--muted);font-size:13.5px}\n.about a{color:var(--acc)}\n.toast{position:fixed;left:50%;top:calc(env(safe-area-inset-top) + 58px);transform:translate(-50%,-8px);opacity:0;pointer-events:none;background:var(--ink);color:var(--bg1);\n  font-size:13px;font-weight:600;padding:7px 12px;border-radius:10px;transition:.25s;z-index:20;line-height:1.35}\n.toast.show{opacity:1;transform:translate(-50%,0)}\n.bar{display:contents}\n@media (orientation:landscape) and (max-height:560px){\n  .head{padding-top:4px;padding-bottom:4px}\n  .bar{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;padding:0 14px 4px;flex-shrink:0}\n  .bar .modes{flex:1.15;min-width:0;padding:0}\n  .bar .legend{flex:1;min-width:0;padding:0;min-height:32px}\n  .states{margin-top:3px}\n  .aboutlink{height:36px;width:36px;padding:0;justify-content:center;font-size:0;gap:0;border-radius:11px}\n  .aboutlink svg{width:17px;height:17px}\n  .zoom{padding:3px;border-radius:12px}\n  .zoom button{width:34px;height:30px}\n  .table{padding-bottom:calc(64px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom))}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){ .orb{animation:none} .sheet,.scrim,.el{transition:none} .dots span{animation:none} }\n\n/* myllm-fullscreen-v2 — MyLLM 5.6.2+ opens this app full screen; the ✕ is the way out. */\n.head .imm-acts{display:none;flex-shrink:0;margin-left:auto}\n.head .acts + .imm-acts{margin-left:0}\nbody.imm .head .imm-acts{display:flex}\n.head .imm-acts button{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:11px;border:1px solid var(--line);\n  background:var(--chip);color:var(--ink);display:grid;place-items:center;padding:0;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .12s}\n.head .imm-acts button:active{transform:scale(.94)}\n.imm-acts svg{width:15px;height:15px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.6;stroke-linecap:round}\n.imm-safe{display:none}\nbody.imm .imm-safe{display:block}\n</style></head><body>\n\n<div class=\"imm-safe\"></div><div class=\"head\">\n  <div class=\"tile\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2.2\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" rx=\"9.5\" ry=\"3.8\"/><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" rx=\"9.5\" ry=\"3.8\" transform=\"rotate(60 12 12)\"/><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" rx=\"9.5\" ry=\"3.8\" transform=\"rotate(120 12 12)\"/></svg></div>\n  <div class=\"ht\"><h1>Periodic Table</h1></div>\n  <div class=\"acts\">\n    <button class=\"hbtn\" id=\"searchBtn\" aria-label=\"Search\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"6.5\"/><path d=\"M16 16l4.5 4.5\"/></svg></button>\n    <button class=\"hbtn\" id=\"quizBtn\" aria-label=\"Quiz\">Quiz</button>\n  </div>\n<div class=\"imm-acts\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Close Periodic Table\" onclick=\"myllmFSClose()\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18\"/></svg></button></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"search\">\n  <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"6.5\"/><path d=\"M16 16l4.5 4.5\"/></svg>\n  <input id=\"q\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Name, symbol or number\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" enterkeyhint=\"searc